	<!-- The days the Zone marks: April 26 and December 14, and the four mainline release
	     dates. Each transmission is "$who: $line". A pool's opens are sent first, one of
	     them soon after the player loads in; its lines follow, shuffled. A line with _one
	     and _many forms counts $n in-game years since the game's story. -->
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_says"><text>$who: $line</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_barman"><text>Barman</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_beard"><text>Beard</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_forester"><text>Forester</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_guide"><text>Guide</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_nimble"><text>Nimble</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_owl"><text>Owl</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_sakharov"><text>Sakharov</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_speaker_sidorovich"><text>Sidorovich</text></string>

	<!-- April 26, International Chernobyl Disaster Remembrance Day -->
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_opens_1"><text>No traffic on any channel. Nobody is working today.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_opens_2"><text>Channel has been open since dawn. Nobody has used it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_opens_3"><text>Quiet on every band. You will not find work today.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_1"><text>Someone is reading names on the long wave. Has been for an hour.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_2"><text>The old hands are not going out. Not today.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_3"><text>Barman poured one and left it on the counter. Did not say who for.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_4"><text>There is a candle at the fire nobody will admit to lighting.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_5"><text>Two stalkers at the fire, neither of them talking.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_6"><text>One of the traders shut up shop at noon. No reason given.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_7"><text>Flowers at the foot of a rusted sign. They will not last the night.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_8"><text>The reading on the long wave has not stopped. Different voice now.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_9"><text>Nobody has fired a shot near the checkpoint all day. Unusual.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_10"><text>Old man at the bar has been nursing the same drink since morning.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_11"><text>Some rookie asked what day it was. Nobody answered him.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_12"><text>Squad went out at first light and came straight back. Did not say why.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_13"><text>The dosimeters read the same as any other day. Feels wrong that they do.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_14"><text>A date scratched into the table. No year with it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_chernobyl_lines_15"><text>The dogs have not started up once.</text></string>

	<!-- December 14, Liquidators' Day -->
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_opens_1"><text>Clear over the reactor. First time in weeks.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_opens_2"><text>Sky is open all the way north. You can see the sarcophagus from the ridge.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_opens_3"><text>No cloud, no wind. They say it always clears on this date.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_1"><text>They went in knowing. That is the part nobody says out loud.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_2"><text>Sky is wrong today. Too clean.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_3"><text>Old man at the fire keeps looking north.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_4"><text>Someone read a list this morning. Short list. All the same year.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_5"><text>No wind. The Zone is holding its breath.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_6"><text>Trader at the bar is giving vodka away. Will not take payment.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_7"><text>Long wave has a man in a lead apron on it. A recording, not a live one.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_8"><text>You can see a long way today. Not sure that is a mercy.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_9"><text>Three of them at the fire, all facing the reactor.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_10"><text>A shovel standing upright in the dirt. Nobody has moved it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_11"><text>Man at the bar says his grandfather came here in eighty-six. Did not say more.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_12"><text>The air is still enough to hear the plant from the ridge.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_13"><text>An old respirator on the bar, polished, hours of it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_14"><text>Squad passed through without a word. All of them clean-shaven.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_liquidators_lines_15"><text>Nobody is selling today. A few are buying drinks.</text></string>

	<!-- March 20, the day Shadow of Chernobyl came out -->
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_opens_1_one"><text>$n year since a man with no memory woke up in a death truck.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_opens_1_many"><text>$n years since a man with no memory woke up in a death truck.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_opens_2"><text>Bar is loud tonight. Somebody started the old arguments again.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_opens_3_one"><text>Storm building. Same as it did $n year back, they say.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_opens_3_many"><text>Storm building. Same as it did $n years back, they say.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_1"><text>Trader's truck came through with bodies in the back, they say. Old story. Comes around every year.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_2"><text>Old hands get strange this week. Something about a man who walked into the Sarcophagus and did not come out.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_3"><text>Sidorovich has had his bunker door shut since morning.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_4"><text>Two rookies arguing about who really did it. Neither of them was here.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_5"><text>Anomalies are busy tonight. Good hunting, if you are mad enough.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_6"><text>Bar is full and loud. Nobody is going out.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_7"><text>Man in the corner bet his whole artefact case that the wish granter is real.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_8"><text>Electros lit up across the whole field. Never seen so many at once.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_9"><text>A man came in asking directions to the reactor. Got laughed out.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_10"><text>There is a tattered jacket for sale and a long story attached to it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_11"><text>The wire hums tonight. Older stalkers say that is normal for the date.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_12"><text>Squad heading out at this hour. Someone talked them into it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_13"><text>Traders raised their prices and blamed the weather.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_14"><text>Repeater went down for ten minutes. Came back with nobody on it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_soc_lines_15"><text>Every rookie in the bar has a theory. None of them were there.</text></string>

	<!-- August 22, the day Clear Sky came out -->
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_opens_1_one"><text>$n year since Clear Sky went into the swamps. Not many came out.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_opens_1_many"><text>$n years since Clear Sky went into the swamps. Not many came out.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_opens_2_one"><text>The marshes took a whole faction. $n year, and nobody has taken the ground back.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_opens_2_many"><text>The marshes took a whole faction. $n years, and nobody has taken the ground back.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_opens_3"><text>Emission season. The swamp crews knew this one better than anybody.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_1"><text>Emission readings up over the marshes. Nothing on the surface yet.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_2"><text>A merc in the bar claims he served in the swamps back then. Nobody believes him.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_3"><text>Faction war talk again. Someone always brings it up this time of year.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_4"><text>Swamp is restless. The ones who used to work it are long gone.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_5"><text>Barometer dropped through the floor an hour ago. The marshes always did know first.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_6"><text>Waterlogged rifle came out of the reeds. Old pattern, nobody makes it now.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_7"><text>Two factions nearly went at it in the bar over something long buried.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_8"><text>The old radio masts in the marsh are picking something up again.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_9"><text>Swamp-salvaged gear on sale and no answer about where from.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_10"><text>A guide refuses to take anyone south today. Will not say why.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_11"><text>Anomaly field shifted overnight. The whole marsh edge has moved.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_12"><text>Man in the corner keeps checking a detector that is not switched on.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_13"><text>Rain coming. The kind that does not stop.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_14"><text>Voices on a dead channel out by the reeds, if you believe him.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cs_lines_15"><text>Nobody has walked the far side of the marsh in a week.</text></string>

	<!-- October 2, the day Call of Pripyat came out -->
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_opens_1_one"><text>$n year since Operation Fairway went down over Pripyat.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_opens_1_many"><text>$n years since Operation Fairway went down over Pripyat.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_opens_2_one"><text>Five helicopters. $n year and they still argue about the fifth.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_opens_2_many"><text>Five helicopters. $n years and they still argue about the fifth.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_opens_3"><text>Military band has been busy all morning. Old frequencies.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_1"><text>Five helicopters. They still argue about the fifth.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_2"><text>The Fairway transmission is playing again. Static and a man counting.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_3"><text>Military flying low over Zaton. Looking for something old.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_4"><text>Scrappers still pull pieces out of Stingray Five. Still worth carrying.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_5"><text>Anyone heading north today is going for the wrong reasons.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_6"><text>A man at Skadovsk is buying anything with military markings. Paying over the odds.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_7"><text>Flight recorder, allegedly. He will not show it to anyone.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_8"><text>The old evac route is busy tonight. Nobody is evacuating.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_9"><text>Two ex-military drinking together. Neither has said a word in an hour.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_10"><text>There is a map going around with five crosses on it. Four crossed out.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_11"><text>Pripyat is quiet on the scanners. Too quiet for the date.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_12"><text>Trader says a pilot's watch came through here once. Sold it fast.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_13"><text>Someone is asking about Yanov like they expect it to be different.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_14"><text>A squad went north at dusk without hiring a guide.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_cop_lines_15"><text>Static on the military band. Just static. Someone is listening to it anyway.</text></string>

	<!-- November 20, the day Heart of Chornobyl came out -->
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_opens_1"><text>Wire has moved again. Further out than the last time.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_opens_2"><text>Maps in the bar are wrong and nobody has drawn new ones.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_opens_3"><text>Something is coming up from the south. Nobody can say what.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_1"><text>Zone is bigger than the maps say. Has been a while now.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_2"><text>Newcomers with gear nobody recognizes, coming up from the south.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_3"><text>Scanner picked up something it had no name for.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_4"><text>A sphere out past the ridge. Looked again and there was nothing.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_5"><text>New faction colors at the checkpoint. Nobody asked whose.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_6"><text>Traders are stocking things that were not made here.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_7"><text>Hiring notice on the board with no destination written on it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_8"><text>Old hands do not like how many people are coming in.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_9"><text>Something went through the treeline at speed. Left no prints.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_10"><text>A guide walked a route he has known for years and did not recognize it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_11"><text>Anomaly two clicks east that nobody has a name for. One of them will name it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_12"><text>Detector at the bar reads something the others do not. Owner will not sell it.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_13"><text>Three expeditions went out this week. One has reported back.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_14"><text>The newcomers talk about the Zone like it is a job.</text></string>
	<string id="st_sotz_rem_hoc_lines_15"><text>Two guides gave different answers for the same route today.</text></string>
</string_table>
